&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;「立呑み神田屋」神田駅前店開店。&lt;/p&gt;
